# Shared heat transfer model of thermal/ (INCLUDEd). Units: mm, W, tonne, s,
# degrees C. Every region has one end held at 100 C (SPC set 1), a heat load
# (load set 1) and a convection surface (CHBDYE, CHBDYG or CHBDYP with CONV)
# to the ambient scalar point 9999 held at 20 C.
